        </a>

        <!-- Button 7: Free APIs List (NEW) -->
        <a href="https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis" class="btn btn-api" target="_blank">
            🔌 Free APIs List
        </a>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2026 Skynet. All rights reserved.
    </div>

</body>
</html>
